activity-relay (3.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Publish the Activity-Relay 3.0 stable release.
  * Select destination-aware dual as the omitted outbound-signature policy
    after mixed Mastodon, Friendica, WordPress, NodeBB, and two-relay testing.
  * Retain explicit legacy and RFC 9421 fixed outbound modes.
  * Promote the accepted Activity-Relay Directory v1 client, manual lifecycle
    commands, and fenced API-process scheduler to stable.
  * Record natural Directory heartbeat aging and controlled unregister/re-register
    acceptance, including the safe single-file Compose bind recreation sequence.
  * Preserve actor identity, Redis state, subscriptions, and existing queue/data
    compatibility across the stable promotion.

