activity-relay (3.0.0~rc1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Prepare the first Activity-Relay 3.0 release candidate.
  * Add inbound and outbound RFC 9421 HTTP Message Signatures with RFC 9530
    Content-Digest support while preserving the legacy Fediverse profile.
  * Add destination-aware dual-profile negotiation with bounded GET fallback
    and no duplicate delivery POST fallback.
  * Add configurable public-address distribution policy and status schema 5.
  * Add the opt-in Activity-Relay Directory v1 client, manual lifecycle
    commands, and fenced automatic scheduler.
  * Preserve legacy as the RC1 outbound-signature default pending mixed-profile
    interoperability evidence.
  * Move repository, CI, and release-artifact authority to Forgejo while
    retaining GitHub as a downstream public mirror and validation surface.

