activity-relay (2.5.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Promote the production-validated RC2 application code to stable 2.5.0.
  * Sign remote actor and object GET requests for Mastodon authorized fetch.
  * Publish the relay actor as Application while preserving its identity.
  * Add receiver delivery health, private metrics, liveness, and readiness.
  * Migrate to the maintained Redis-only Machinery v2 transport.
  * Add leased in-flight claims and documented at-least-once recovery.
  * Retry each fan-out target five times after the initial attempt.
  * Retain shared activity bodies across the complete retry horizon.
  * Decrement remain_count only after target success or final exhaustion.
  * Add bounded structured delivery diagnostics and regression coverage.
  * Publish stable documentation and reviewed release notes.

